artifact_interpretation:
The run completed as a PASS real provider Full WOW v1.2 integrated organism observation.
Six real Gemini semantic actors participated before Root. DRS v0.2 remembered prior traces but did not decide. AVF v0.2 hard-masked unsafe routes and ranked safe directions without authorizing. BSEP carried bounded context only. Orchestrator, Architect, and branch actors returned semantic proposals only. Root boundary was evaluated. Root created the scoped Supplier A ActionCommitPacket v0.2 model. MockBankSandbox v0.2 consumed that scoped packet inside deterministic contract/commit plane, created mock payment intent, mock consent, mock order, and mock receipt evidence. Receipt remained evidence only. Supplier B remained blocked. Shipment remained held. No real-world effects occurred.

